flowchart TD
    A[Landing Page /] --> B{Choose path}
    B -->|Tips and Advice| T1[Tips List Public]
    T1 --> T2[Read categorized health tips]
    T2 --> A

    B -->|Use as Health Professional| C[Login Page]
    B -->|Register| R1[Registration Page]

    R1 --> R2[Submit registration form]
    R2 --> R3[Account created inactive + profile created]
    R3 --> R4[Activation email sent]
    R4 --> R5{User clicks activation link?}
    R5 -->|Yes valid token| R6[Account activated + auto login]
    R6 --> P1[Create Patient Page]
    R5 -->|No or invalid| C

    C --> C1{Credentials valid?}
    C1 -->|No| C2[Show error stay on login]
    C2 --> C
    C1 -->|Yes| H[Home Page]

    C --> F1[Forgot password]
    F1 --> F2[Reset email request]
    F2 --> F3[Reset link]
    F3 --> C

    H --> P1

    P1 --> P2[Enter child + guardian details]
    P2 --> P3{Screening selection}

    P3 -->|Dental only| D1[Dental Screening]
    P3 -->|Dietary only| DI1[Dietary Screening]
    P3 -->|Both| DI1

    DI1 --> DI2{perform both?}
    DI2 -->|Yes| D1
    DI2 -->|No| REP[Referral Report]

    D1 --> D2{Save draft?}
    D2 -->|Yes| PL[Patient List / Referrals Hub]
    D2 -->|No| REP

    REP --> REP1[View patient + screening summary]
    REP1 --> REP2[ML risk prediction preview]
    REP2 --> REP3[Generate/preview PDF]
    REP3 --> REP4[Optional send report email]
    REP4 --> REP5[Complete referral details]
    REP5 --> REP6[Proceed to booking]

    REP6 --> CL[Clinics / Practitioners Selection]
    CL --> CL1{Choose destination}

    CL1 -->|Clinic| RC1[Create clinic referral]
    CL1 -->|Practitioner| RP1[Create practitioner referral]

    RC1 --> RC2[Validate appointment slot]
    RC2 --> RC3[Create referral record]
    RC3 --> RC4[Send clinic email + attach PDF]
    RC4 --> PL

    RP1 --> RP2[Validate appointment slot]
    RP2 --> RP3[Create referral record]
    RP3 --> RP4[Create in-app notification]
    RP4 --> PL

    PL --> PL1[Patients tab]
    PL --> PL2[Sent Referrals tab]
    PL --> PL3[Received Referrals tab]

    PL1 --> D1
    PL1 --> DI1
    PL1 --> REP

    PL2 --> RD[Referral Detail]
    PL3 --> RD

    RD --> RD1[View timeline status details]
    RD1 --> RD2[Add comments]
    RD2 --> RD3{Receiver updates status?}
    RD3 -->|Yes| RD4[Status: acknowledged/in-progress/completed]
    RD3 -->|No| RD5[No change]
    RD4 --> END1[Referral lifecycle continues]
    RD5 --> END1

    RP4 --> N1[Notification bell updates]
    N1 --> N2[Notifications page]
    N2 --> RD

    PL2 --> PDFR[Download referral PDF]
    PL3 --> PDFR

    EXT1[External public referral portal token URL] --> EXT2[View referral no login]
    EXT2 --> EXT3{Acknowledge?}
    EXT3 -->|Yes| EXT4[Status updated to acknowledged]
    EXT3 -->|No| EXT5[View only]

    H --> PR1[Profile drawer]
    PR1 --> PR2[View/edit profile]
    PR1 --> PR3[Change password]
    PR1 --> PR4[Logout]
    PR4 --> C